# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problem instances from QOBLIB (Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library) [\\[2\\]](#references) are stored in a simple text format. Let's examine the actual content of our target instance `ms_03_200_177.dat`:\n"
msgstr "Probleminstanzen aus QOBLIB (Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library) [\\[2\\]](#references) werden in einem einfachen Textformat gespeichert. Schauen wir uns den tatsächlichen Inhalt unserer Zielinstanz `ms_03_200_177.dat` an:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Format structure:**\n"
